# Contributing to Finoana 🤍

Thank you for your interest in contributing to **Finoana**.  
Whether you are fixing a bug, improving documentation, refining UI, or proposing new ideas, your contribution is welcome and appreciated.

Finoana aims to be a **safe, respectful, and intentional community**, and this philosophy also applies to how we collaborate.

---

## Before You Start

Please take a moment to:
- Read this document fully
- Review the [Code of Conduct](CODE_OF_CONDUCT)
- Ensure your contribution aligns with the vision of Finoana

> [!NOTE]
> Contributions should reflect kindness, clarity, and respect for both users and contributors.

---

## Repository Overview

Finoana is structured as a **monorepo** powered by Turborepo.

```text
apps/
  docs/        → Documentation & landing website
  web/         → Main web application
  mobile/      → Mobile application (Expo)

packages/
  ui/          → Shared UI components & design system
  config/      → Shared configuration (ESLint, Tailwind, etc.)
